5,1,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. I want to make sure we choose a system that is truly sustainable for us. I'll look into support ownership during last winter's outage and warehouse rule changes after new accounts.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree that sustainability is key. I want to see how the system handles our actual environment. I'll look into the depot calendar and the peak-season cutover, as well as yard devices and the 2021 scheduling trial.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"I'm with you on the sustainability part, but I'm more worried about things rotting from the inside. I'll check the upgrade history of the dispatch tool and the data lift in the 2018 pay move.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I think we need to consider the people who will actually use and maintain this. I'll look into administrator retirements and hiring times, and depot supervisors and the last rollout.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It seems we have the operational and human elements well-covered. To ensure we aren't surprised by the long-term financial commitments, I'll examine the board minutes on capital and operating requests and five years of renewal invoices.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Midori,,"It seems we have a very comprehensive plan. Does anyone feel we've missed a critical angle, or are we all comfortable with these selections before we proceed?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I believe we have covered the primary risks. By examining the physical constraints, the financial history, and the human element, we should have a clear picture of what to avoid. I am comfortable proceeding.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"I'm perfectly happy with this. It's a balanced approach, and I think we'll find exactly where the skeletons are hidden. Let's get to it.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I agree. We have a good spread of technical, financial, and personnel perspectives. I am ready to proceed.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. It is rare that we achieve such a harmonious distribution of labor so quickly. I believe we have cast a wide enough net to catch any lurking surprises. I am also ready.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Midori,,"Since we are all in agreement, I think we can move forward. I'm looking forward to seeing what we discover.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
