18,1,3,talk,May,,I'm curious to see if my suspicions about our past failures are confirmed. I'll be waiting for the results.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
19,1,3,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
20,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll be waiting as well. I hope the data gives us a clear indication of how to support our staff during this transition.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,1,3,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I shall await the findings with equal anticipation. It will be fascinating to see if the numbers align with the narratives we've been told.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
